{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 37,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        126.61820220947266,
        27.289522171020508,
        326.90234375,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "5. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON THE NEWBORN CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.1315002441406,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Vitamin K prophylaxis has been shown to reduce sub-clinical deficiency in the first",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.0328674316406,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "week of life (measured as the presence of a protein induced by vitamin K deficiency,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.0228576660156,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "or PIVKA). There was no significant difference between oral or IM vitamin K on",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.1028137207031,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "subclinical deficiency in the first week of life. Studies have also looked as prothrombin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.1129150390625,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "time (PT) but none of the studies that included infants had a PT outside the normal",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.0828857421875,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "range in the intervention and control groups. Two studies, which examined the effect",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.0827331542969,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "of vitamin K prophylaxis on prothrombin complex deficiency, reported that IM",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        333.0228576660156,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "prophylaxis reduced deficiency by 72% and oral prophylaxis by 50%.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.10150146484375,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Data from two observational studies showed that vitamin K prophylaxis – single",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.122802734375,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "dose administered at birth by either IM or oral route – reduces the incidence of late",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        399.0528259277344,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "VKDB substantially; prophylaxis by IM route was significantly better (about 97%)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.05291748046875,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "than that by the oral route (65–83%) in reducing the incidence of late VKDB. Although",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        399.0928649902344,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "late VKDB is rare, about one third of infants with this condition die or have severe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.7421112060547,
        399.1130065917969,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "handicaps. The NNT estimated from two observational studies (incidence with no",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        241.7421112060547,
        399.0227355957031,
        255.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "vitamin K prophylaxis, 6 per 100 000) is about 18 000. If the incidence were 30 per",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        254.7421112060547,
        399.15277099609375,
        268.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "100 000, the number needed to treat to prevent a case of late VKDB is about 3000. The",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        267.7420959472656,
        274.7129821777344,
        281.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "quality of this evidence was graded as low or very low.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        292.2607116699219,
        163.95286560058594,
        304.2507019042969
      ],
      "text": "5.1.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        307.9053955078125,
        88.77290344238281,
        320.0453796386719
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        320.9153747558594,
        399.0928039550781,
        334.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Vitamin K prophylaxis significantly reduces the risk of bleeding in neonates. Twenty",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        333.9153747558594,
        399.0529479980469,
        347.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "neonates undergoing circumcision need to be given prophylaxis to prevent one case",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        346.9153747558594,
        399.0528869628906,
        360.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "of bleeding after circumcision. About 80 neonates need to be given prophylaxis to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        359.9153747558594,
        399.13275146484375,
        373.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "prevent one case of non-circumcision bleeding. Late VKDB can be prevented with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        372.9153747558594,
        360.18280029296875,
        386.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "vitamin K prophylaxis – one case prevented per about 3000 infants treated.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        394.4093017578125,
        78.65290069580078,
        406.5492858886719
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        407.4192810058594,
        399.0428466796875,
        420.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "The first report of a potential association between vitamin K prophylaxis and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        420.4192810058594,
        399.0828857421875,
        433.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "childhood cancer appeared in 1990. Subsequent research has not substantiated this",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        433.4192810058594,
        93.93289184570312,
        446.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "concern.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        457.9378967285156,
        207.81297302246094,
        469.9278869628906
      ],
      "text": "5.1.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        473.59246826171875,
        399.1628112792969,
        487.0824890136719
      ],
      "text": "Vitamin K intervention is effective but the disease it prevents is relatively rare.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        486.59246826171875,
        399.06292724609375,
        500.0824890136719
      ],
      "text": "Current practice in most developed countries is to give vitamin K prophylaxis to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        499.59246826171875,
        399.0527648925781,
        513.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "all newborn babies after birth. The cost of the medicine itself is US$ 0.195 per 1 mg",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        512.5924682617188,
        399.10272216796875,
        526.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "injection. Costs of the syringe and needle and the supply of vitamin K, etc. would be",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        525.5924682617188,
        399.0228271484375,
        539.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "additional. The costs for routine vitamin K administration may not be justifiable in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        538.5924682617188,
        146.962890625,
        552.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "low-resource settings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        562.14013671875,
        344.2880554199219,
        575.3291015625
      ],
      "text": "5.2\t Prophylactic antibiotics in newborns at risk of infection",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        578.7658081054688,
        399.0828552246094,
        592.2557983398438
      ],
      "text": "A neonate with risk factors for infection (i.e. membranes ruptured > 18 hours before",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        591.7658081054688,
        399.0927429199219,
        605.2557983398438
      ],
      "text": "delivery, mother had fever > 38 °C before delivery or during labour, or amniotic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        604.7658081054688,
        399.0428771972656,
        618.2557983398438
      ],
      "text": "fluid was foul smelling or purulent) should be treated with prophylactic antibiotics",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.41819763183594,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.62620544433594,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "23",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}